      "output": "To say thank you politely in Mandarin, you can use \"Xièxie\" (谢谢) for general situations. For a more formal or sincere expression, especially when someone has done you a significant favor, use \"Fēicháng gǎnxiè\" (非常感谢), which means \"thank you very much.\" Adding \"Nín\" (您), the respectful form of \"you,\" before the thanks can also enhance politeness in formal contexts.",
